e\", and that title is not in the client (`notes/Build Guides/Content/Jobs/Miner.md:178`). The guide treats it as the Gear Up! step. This is unproven and is not a separate quest to build.\n- **Reminder text 1727271980** (\"Have you finished doing what Cleetus has asked you to do?\") is a dialogue line, not a quest. I found no quest record for it.\n- **Reward and text evidence.** Only Your First Weapon (16 coins) and Fighting the Pack (18 coins, from the wiki) have evidenced coin rewards. The built file gives Fighting the Pack rewards that I did not re-c",
